      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Rule priority is dimension specificity: pod > node > workload.\nThat ordering is what keeps this three deep. Ordering by parent kind\nflattens the last two into siblings, and the claim that the retry\nis caused by the pull failure goes with it.",
